      },
      "message": "feat: Add missing platform-specific parameters to Zihpm extension\n\n- Add NUM_HPM_COUNTERS parameter (0-29 additional counters)\n- Add UNIMPLEMENTED_HPM_BEHAVIOR parameter (illegal_instruction/constant_value)\n- Add UNIMPLEMENTED_HPM_CONSTANT_VALUE parameter (32-bit constant)\n- Document 64-bit counter width requirement per ISA manual clarification\n\nFixes #69\n\nSigned-off-by: Sukuna0007Abhi <appsonly310@gmail.com>",
